### Gold Lane Default (Gold)

- Items: Swift Boots, Corrosion Scythe, Demon Hunter Sword, Golden Staff, Malefic Gun, Wind of Nature
- Core: Corrosion Scythe, Demon Hunter Sword, Golden Staff
- Emblem: Marksman Emblem with Swift, Weapon Master, Quantum Charge
- Battle spell: Inspire
- Flex: Haas's Claws over Wind of Nature when Use when the enemy cannot burst Moskov through the front line and sustained lifesteal matters more than physical immunity.; Malefic Roar over Malefic Gun when Use when the enemy front line stacks Physical Defense and range is less important than scaling penetration.; Rose Gold Meteor over Wind of Nature when Use against magic or mixed burst where Wind Chant will not stop the first engage.
- Total cost: 10970 gold

Default gold lane setup that rushes Moskov's attack-effect engine, then adds range and one physical-burst answer for objective fights.

### Front-to-Back Anti-Tank (Gold)

