- Core: Corrosion Scythe, Demon Hunter Sword, Golden Staff
- Emblem: Marksman Emblem with Swift, Weapon Master, Quantum Charge
- Battle spell: Inspire
- Flex: Malefic Gun over Malefic Roar when Use when the enemy has only moderate armor and Moskov needs safer attack range to keep piercing through the first target.; Wind of Nature over Sea Halberd when Use if a physical assassin or fighter can reach Moskov before anti-heal value decides the fight.; Haas's Claws over Sea Halberd when Use when the enemy front line is durable but not built around healing, shielding, or extra-HP bruisers.
- Total cost: 11050 gold

Tank-breaking setup for grouped fights where Moskov can stand behind peel and pierce through the nearest durable target.

### CC-Heavy Survival (Gold)

